Description: Pars School Admin Console
 Fleet oversight for Pardus classroom labs: enrollment, signed
 session grants, conflict detection, audit logging, bulk import and
 backup. Orchestrates Epoptes via a grant-gated broker rather than
 reimplementing screen control (see TASKS.md's B7 findings).
